{"id": "lib/ui2/onboarding/pairing.dart:offset-10003", "file": "lib/ui2/onboarding/pairing.dart", "location": "offset-10003", "text": "'A band that has just come off the charger can take up to half a '\n'minute to start advertising.'", "sha256": "bf8f7118629b4e0a788136c44656bbac22b9e9d873c857722154832d53ea1221", "kind": "dart", "start": 10003, "end": 10114, "line": 270}
{"id": "lib/ui2/onboarding/pairing.dart:offset-10180", "file": "lib/ui2/onboarding/pairing.dart", "location": "offset-10180", "text": "'Nothing answered the scan. The band advertises only when it is '\n'awake and not already connected to another phone.'", "sha256": "195b1e71d49a96fc7089b29141e2b8a1e47e8c0bc81eb521c5d003271806e8bc", "kind": "dart", "start": 10180, "end": 10311, "line": 273}
{"id": "lib/ui2/onboarding/pairing.dart:offset-10383", "file": "lib/ui2/onboarding/pairing.dart", "location": "offset-10383", "text": "'The link came up, but the band would not accept the encryption '\n'key. That is almost always a stale pairing record on this '\n'phone rather than a fault in the band.'", "sha256": "505bfff4cb28a919ce822dba7d754f30051a97d960f46e9bbd1ace2cfb151cc8", "kind": "dart", "start": 10383, "end": 10578, "line": 276}
{"id": "lib/ui2/onboarding/pairing.dart:offset-10646", "file": "lib/ui2/onboarding/pairing.dart", "location": "offset-10646", "text": "'The system picker was dismissed before a band was chosen.'", "sha256": "ee955a9e16297d93817d85ef5836a88d76672be2f077fffea7828b262698cea9", "kind": "dart", "start": 10646, "end": 10705, "line": 280}
{"id": "lib/ui2/onboarding/pairing.dart:offset-10767", "file": "lib/ui2/onboarding/pairing.dart", "location": "offset-10767", "text": "'The band was reachable but the session did not finish.'", "sha256": "48284392855b8f02f57e7122ced031e9316af4662215c53d7b98957bb5ca260b", "kind": "dart", "start": 10767, "end": 10823, "line": 282}
{"id": "lib/ui2/onboarding/pairing.dart:offset-10875", "file": "lib/ui2/onboarding/pairing.dart", "location": "offset-10875", "text": "'Setting up the first sync.'", "sha256": "1b65a4baa4372c6ef9b5322142717e087e2600e774aa7703028a8864e978686b", "kind": "dart", "start": 10875, "end": 10903, "line": 283}
{"id": "lib/ui2/onboarding/pairing.dart:offset-11087", "file": "lib/ui2/onboarding/pairing.dart", "location": "offset-11087", "text": "'Find my band'", "sha256": "43b3cb815f93a269d40b6102c70e69c16282ef5f72ee9f6b26093382a3a40bdd", "kind": "dart", "start": 11087, "end": 11101, "line": 290}
{"id": "lib/ui2/onboarding/pairing.dart:offset-11226", "file": "lib/ui2/onboarding/pairing.dart", "location": "offset-11226", "text": "'Open the picker again'", "sha256": "1865aeb43c4de292903450211aa4a09ef54bf1e479898dbd15d66636b047ed70", "kind": "dart", "start": 11226, "end": 11249, "line": 292}
{"id": "lib/ui2/onboarding/pairing.dart:offset-11343", "file": "lib/ui2/onboarding/pairing.dart", "location": "offset-11343", "text": "'Try again'", "sha256": "d37e111627bb03394c703e1a463dcaeccc854b395b47fb11555e02cc44db47ca", "kind": "dart", "start": 11343, "end": 11354, "line": 294}
{"id": "lib/ui2/onboarding/pairing.dart:offset-11718", "file": "lib/ui2/onboarding/pairing.dart", "location": "offset-11718", "text": "'Three things stop a band answering'", "sha256": "daf09301129c72c5496f51bd23765f91d3818c20e01049a84c7174d5bb142b46", "kind": "dart", "start": 11718, "end": 11754, "line": 306}
{"id": "lib/ui2/onboarding/pairing.dart:offset-11816", "file": "lib/ui2/onboarding/pairing.dart", "location": "offset-11816", "text": "'It is still on the charger; it is out of range; or it is '\n'still connected to another phone or to the vendor app.'", "sha256": "b29c5e3e381d625c45e2c309101b4679f9e7069c17e8f478557295e1b68c66c2", "kind": "dart", "start": 11816, "end": 11952, "line": 308}
{"id": "lib/ui2/onboarding/pairing.dart:offset-12018", "file": "lib/ui2/onboarding/pairing.dart", "location": "offset-12018", "text": "'Force-quit the other app, then scan again'", "sha256": "48526af09695901a03b975754a8943519d482dbe6df96a7b4042467b942f823a", "kind": "dart", "start": 12018, "end": 12061, "line": 311}
{"id": "lib/ui2/onboarding/pairing.dart:offset-12285", "file": "lib/ui2/onboarding/pairing.dart", "location": "offset-12285", "text": "'Forget the band in Bluetooth settings first'", "sha256": "d445fb30a2e648255416e39218b76c519240ee0b4239c17ec87bdb3f3d03c949", "kind": "dart", "start": 12285, "end": 12330, "line": 319}
{"id": "lib/ui2/onboarding/pairing.dart:offset-12395", "file": "lib/ui2/onboarding/pairing.dart", "location": "offset-12395", "text": "'Open the phone’s Bluetooth settings, forget the band, '\n'then scan again here. The refused key is the old pairing '\n'record, and only the system can clear it.'", "sha256": "85e51be53b6f04bdb4b962f5274d2a565ef6dbb15870ee7443de2f074d8052f7", "kind": "dart", "start": 12395, "end": 12595, "line": 321}
{"id": "lib/ui2/onboarding/pairing.dart:offset-12648", "file": "lib/ui2/onboarding/pairing.dart", "location": "offset-12648", "text": "'Open Bluetooth settings'", "sha256": "7e92974e6a86e1106bb76fc0a98d9f85762d95bc109cf1230beb6a2a843b6741", "kind": "dart", "start": 12648, "end": 12673, "line": 324}
