{"id": "lib/ui2/onboarding/profile_setup.dart:offset-5070", "file": "lib/ui2/onboarding/profile_setup.dart", "location": "offset-5070", "text": "'About you'", "sha256": "a192acff93525e55e208e2f582c62eef629e67d13ce6c6127157bfefaae8103a", "kind": "dart", "start": 5070, "end": 5081, "line": 138}
{"id": "lib/ui2/onboarding/profile_setup.dart:offset-5251", "file": "lib/ui2/onboarding/profile_setup.dart", "location": "offset-5251", "text": "'Four numbers change how your data is scored. Leave any of them '\n'blank and only the metrics that need it stay unavailable.'", "sha256": "2f4a1f1819fd0cdaa76bc26420565835534e593b31242c75d85b13d19d731b04", "kind": "dart", "start": 5251, "end": 5398, "line": 143}
{"id": "lib/ui2/onboarding/profile_setup.dart:offset-6475", "file": "lib/ui2/onboarding/profile_setup.dart", "location": "offset-6475", "text": "'Calories use the mean of the two published sets. Training '\n'load and strain have only two published constants and no '\n'third, so they use the male pair.'", "sha256": "0c4743a513cc79ed5e3ffb0bef43d553c233d955f0ebe46d8847038fc7dd9814", "kind": "dart", "start": 6475, "end": 6679, "line": 170}
{"id": "lib/ui2/onboarding/profile_setup.dart:offset-7002", "file": "lib/ui2/onboarding/profile_setup.dart", "location": "offset-7002", "text": "'Without it: heart-rate zones, calories, fitness age.'", "sha256": "2bbd49e620d6aae0706e3a134c7574274a36be7918b5debfa87282f8139c1a08", "kind": "dart", "start": 7002, "end": 7056, "line": 180}
{"id": "lib/ui2/onboarding/profile_setup.dart:offset-7244", "file": "lib/ui2/onboarding/profile_setup.dart", "location": "offset-7244", "text": "'Without it: stride length, and distance from steps.'", "sha256": "cc9542dde2cffbf423cca4d9866d1a7339a627a73082368ef643218d7bb2df33", "kind": "dart", "start": 7244, "end": 7297, "line": 184}
{"id": "lib/ui2/onboarding/profile_setup.dart:offset-7485", "file": "lib/ui2/onboarding/profile_setup.dart", "location": "offset-7485", "text": "'Without it: calories and training load.'", "sha256": "4ebf85d167ef34cadf8f832a6da9015fede973af4d77fc30d5105f2ab86ee4b1", "kind": "dart", "start": 7485, "end": 7526, "line": 188}
